<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">PLATFORM OWNER</view><view class="title">老板总控登录</view><view class="card"><view class="muted">微信身份必须由平台预先绑定为管理员。</view><button class="button spaced" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="wechat">微信管理员登录</button><view class="muted spaced">或使用管理员账号</view><input class="input spaced" value="{{username}}" bindinput="username" placeholder="管理员账号"/><input class="input spaced" password value="{{password}}" bindinput="password" placeholder="密码"/><button class="secondary spaced" loading="{{busy}}" bindtap="submit">账号登录</button><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view></view></view>
